# {{title}}: Claude Design folder

This folder prepares the **{{title}}** prototype of **{{projectName}}** for Claude Design and hands the
result back to Claude Code. It holds only what a design agent needs: the brief, the screens and
components of the project model, the platform's design tokens and agent instructions. Import it on
its own; it does not need the rest of the repository.

## Design with Claude Design

1. Pull the latest project so this folder matches the current project model.
2. In Claude Design, start a project and import this folder (`{{folder}}`): attach it as a local
   folder, or link the repository and select this folder.
3. Ask Claude Design to read `AGENTS.md` and build an interactive prototype for one screen or flow
   from `context/screens.md`.
4. Save the prototypes into `prototypes/` (exported HTML) and images into `assets/`, update
   `handoff/implementation-map.md`, then commit.

## Implement with Claude Code

Ask Claude Code to implement the `ready` rows of `handoff/implementation-map.md` following
`handoff/HANDOFF.md`. The prototypes are references, not source code: the implementation uses the
project's own components, tokens and gates.

## Keep it in sync

```sh
{{statusCommand}}
{{syncCommand}}
```

`status` reports whether the project model changed since this folder was prepared and how many
prototypes it holds. `sync` regenerates the generated files from the current model. It never touches
`prototypes/`, `assets/`, `notes/` or `handoff/implementation-map.md`, and it refuses to overwrite a
generated file that was edited by hand.

## Layout

| Path | Contents |
| --- | --- |
| `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` | Instructions for the design agent and for Claude Code. |
| `context/` | Generated brief, screens, components, design tokens and the project model snapshot. |
| `handoff/HANDOFF.md` | Generated checklist for implementing a prototype in the frontend. |
| `handoff/implementation-map.md` | Screen-by-screen status, shared by designers and Claude Code. |
| `prototypes/`, `assets/`, `notes/` | Design work. Never regenerated. |
| `design.manifest.json` | Which files are generated, their hashes and the project source they came from. |

